  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE_README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.9: PR selection now uses the unique merge base, supports explicit credential-safe --fetch-missing acquisition for absent provider objects, and reports comparison and path-count verification. Author-period analysis now pipelines bounded repository, snapshot, file-analysis, and estimation work with single-flight caches; gains are workload-dependent and near-linear core scaling is not yet established. Repository EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated, and seed-rules/0.4.0 remains the shipped estimator. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.9/CHANGELOG.md",
